      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.68 (vs ₹1.42 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.68 (down from ₹1.42 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹6.55b (down 27% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹91.1m (down 52% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 1.4% (down from 2.1% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 28% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 58% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
